  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0142" xml:lang="en">
        <div type="envelope">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00612/" ed="1r" type="envelope"/>
          <ab hand="#hand_blue_auden">
            <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_220">Professor 
            <lb/>Herta Staub</rs>
            <address>
              <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_514">Thaliastrasse 149/7 
              <lb/>1160 <foreign xml:lang="de">Wien</foreign></rs>
            </address>   
          </ab>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00613/" ed="1v" type="envelope"/>
          <ab hand="#hand_blue_auden">
            <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">W.H. Auden</rs>
            <seg hand="#print_black_auden">
              <address>
                <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_2">3062 KIRCHSTETTEN
                  <lb/><foreign xml:lang="de">BEZ.</foreign> ST. PÖLTEN
                  <lb/>HINTERHOLZ 6
                  <lb/><foreign xml:lang="de">N.-Ö.</foreign>, AUSTRIA</rs>
              </address>
            </seg>
          </ab>
          <ab hand="#stamp_gray_wsl">
            <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_240"><foreign xml:lang="de"><gap unit="char" quantity="1" reason="illegible"></gap><unclear>IENE</unclear>R STADT- U. LANDESBIBL.</foreign></rs><gap unit="char" quantity="4" reason="illegible"></gap> 
          </ab>
        </div>
        <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00614/" ed="2r" type="sheet"/>
          <div type="letter_message" hand="#hand_blue_auden">
            <opener>
              <dateline>
                <date>
                  <lb/><del rend="overstrike" hand="#hand_blue_auden"><gap unit="char" atLeast="1" atMost="2" reason="illegible"></gap></del>June 7<hi rend="superscript">th</hi>
                </date>
                <seg hand="#print_black_auden">
                  <placeName>
                    <address>
                      <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_2">3062 KIRCHSTETTEN
                        <lb/><foreign xml:lang="de">BEZ.</foreign> ST. PÖLTEN
                        <lb/>HINTERHOLZ 6
                        <lb/><foreign xml:lang="de">N.-Ö.</foreign>, AUSTRIA</rs>
                    </address>
                  </placeName>
                </seg>
              </dateline>
              <salute hand="#hand_blue_auden">
                <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_220"><subst><del rend="overwritten" hand="#hand_blue_auden"><unclear>M</unclear></del><add place="superimposed" hand="#hand_blue_auden">Professor</add></subst> Staub</rs><unclear>,</unclear>
              </salute>
            </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/>Many thanks for your le<unclear>t</unclear>ter, I'm
                <lb/>so glad the possib<unclear>i</unclear>lities of publication
                <lb/>look promising<unclear>.</unclear>
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>One little point. In <rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_325"><hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_auden">Old People's Home</hi></rs>
                <lb/>you translated <hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_auden">Hey-day</hi> as <hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_auden">Jugend</hi><unclear>;</unclear>
                <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_auden">Hey-day</hi> is <hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_auden">Blut<unclear>e</unclear>rzeit</hi>, a product of
                <lb/>maturity not youth. The <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_157">fr<subst><del rend="overwritten" hand="#hand_blue_auden"><unclear>e</unclear><gap unit="char" quantity="1" reason="illegible"></gap></del><add place="superimposed" hand="#hand_blue_auden">ie<unclear>n</unclear>d</add></subst></rs> I was 
                <lb/>writing about was 56 when I first
                <lb/>met her.
              </p>
            <closer>
              <salute>
                <lb/>With best wishes
                <lb/>yours ever
              </salute>
              <signed>
                <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Wystan Auden</rs>
              </signed>
            </closer>
          </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00615/" ed="2v" type="sheet"/>
          <div>
            <ab hand="#stamp_gray_wsl">
              <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_240"><foreign xml:lang="de"><gap unit="char" quantity="4" reason="illegible"></gap>ER STADT- U. LANDESBIBL.</foreign></rs> <space quantity="1" unit="char"/>4
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
